        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia D50251 Ornate Decorative Lever Entry Door Locksets</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia very decorative design leverset for residential and commercial entry doors (for doors that require secure locking). Built to withstand heavy use, combining  precision engineering for security and durability with attractive designs. The ornate tall backplates feature a unique inside-to-outside mounting with screwless outside plates.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEach set contains door  levers. backplates, latches, spindle, and all necessary screws and templates. Key functions are supplied with lock cylinder/s and turnpiece as applicable. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia D50251 Decorative Design Entry Lockset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backplate Height 17-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Spacing (distance between deadbolt and lever latch): 3-5/8\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1 3/4\" - 2\" Thick Doors (Contact us if doors are thicker)</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits Standard Pre-Drilled Doors, 2-1/8\" Bore Holes</li>\r\n<li>Will Fit Narrow Stiles (3-5/8\" with 2-3/8\" Backset Latches)</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass Levers and Trim</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt: Full 1\" Throw, Solid Brass with Saw-proof Insert.</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Standard \"C\" keyway supplied with two nickel silver keys.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dummy Pair: Stationary both sides of door. Fixed levers, non-functioning. Used as door pulls or to match trim. </li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Entry: Latchbolt operates by lever from either side. Deadbolt activated by key outside and by turnpiece inside. </li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Entry: Latchbolt operates by lever from either side. Deadbolt activated only by key from either side. </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ornate Decorative Lever Entry Lockset, Omnia D50251",
                "description": "Omnia D50251 Entry Locksets - Omnia Decorative Ornate door lever available in Polished Brass or Shaded Bronze.  Very decorative design door hardware for residential and commercial entry doors (for doors that require secure locking).",
